msgctxt "#30303"
msgid "Playlist Organization"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30304"
msgid "Choose how playlist downloads are organized and tagged. Playlist Compilation groups songs under the playlist name with Various Artists as the album artist, while preserving each song’s actual artist. Original Albums organizes songs under their original artists and albums. This setting does not affect album or individual track downloads."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30305"
msgid "Playlist Compilation — Various Artists"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30306"
msgid "Original Albums"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30307"
msgid "Scan Library After Download"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30308"
msgid "Scan only the downloaded album or playlist folders after a batch finishes. Canceled downloads do not trigger a scan. Leave this off to keep downloads outside your music library. Files placed in an already scanned source may still be added by a later library scan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30309"
msgid "Ask About Options Each Download"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30310"
msgid "Show your download folder and organization options before each download, with the option to change them for that download only. Turn this off to use your saved settings automatically. A download confirmation still appears."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30311"
msgid "Add Downloaded Playlists to My Playlists"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30312"
msgid "Automatically save completed playlist downloads to My Playlists in their original order, including existing library songs and downloaded files. Unavailable songs are omitted. Albums, individual songs, and canceled downloads are not added automatically. Retries update the same saved playlist."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30313"
msgid "Direct Downloads"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30314"
msgid "Get MusicMP3.ru files through track, album, and playlist context menus. Playback streaming settings are separate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30315"
msgid "Simultaneous Downloads"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30316"
msgid "MusicMP3.ru allows two connections at a time, shared by downloading and streaming. With nothing streaming, this many tracks download at once. While a MusicMP3.ru song plays, downloads drop to one at a time (see While Streaming). Playing music from your Kodi library, videos or other add-ons uses no connection and never slows downloads. Changes apply right away."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30317"
msgid "1"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30318"
msgid "2"
msgstr ""


msgctxt "#30320"
msgid "Download Notifications"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30321"
msgid "Choose continuous progress, brief milestones at 25%, 50%, and 75%, or only a completion summary. Downloads screens always show continuous progress while work is active. Progress hides in the full-screen player."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30322"
msgid "Continuous Progress"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30323"
msgid "Milestones"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30324"
msgid "When Finished"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30325"
msgid "While Streaming from MusicMP3.ru"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30326"
msgid "MusicMP3.ru allows two connections at a time, shared by streaming and downloading. Keep Downloading downloads one track at a time while you stream; a track close to finishing is never interrupted. Wait Until Streaming Stops holds new downloads while Rotation streams from MusicMP3.ru, including mixed playlists, and resumes them automatically afterwards; a track already downloading is allowed to finish. Playing your Kodi library, videos or other add-ons never affects downloads."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30327"
msgid "Keep Downloading"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30328"
msgid "Wait Until Streaming Stops"
